      <div class="cda-fit">
        <h2>Where Stream fits</h2>
        <p>Stream is an ambient scribe plus document intake, and it is opinionated about the third benefit above: every visit updates a chart organized by medical problem rather than adding another dated document. Six months in, the record is organized the way clinicians think about patients — by problem, not by date.</p>
        <p>It works alongside any EHR rather than replacing it, and the finished note copies over in one click. It does not write back, it is not SOC 2 certified, and it offers no clinical decision support. If any of those is a hard requirement, a different product is the right answer, and we would rather say so now than on a call in three weeks.</p>
